    },
    {
      "path": "examples/logits/README.md",
      "line": 60,
      "kinds": [
        "protocol_capture_audit"
      ],
      "text": "d individual reports. A model's wrong answer or failure to finish is recorded as an outcome rather than causing the harness to hide the remaining cases. Setup, protocol and validator errors stop the run.",
